 ("Building a gradient","The loop of Henle pumps salt to make the inner kidney very salty.",["loop_of_henle","renal_medulla"]),
 ("Fine adjustment","The distal tubule adjusts Na+, K+, Ca2+ and acid under hormonal control.",["distal_tubule"]),
